   L + M + C + K. Row-stochastic softmax produces implicit token-graph
   Laplacian with smallest eigenvalue ~0 (connected, 1e-17). LayerNorm
   Class K asymptote to unit variance to ε.

2. Tool-use loop (Yao 2022 arXiv:2210.03629 ReAct) class chain:
   D + E + C + M + I + A. Dispatch picks tool; catalog looks up impl;
   irreversible env call canonicalised as NDJSON; HDC bind obs into
   state; cyclic until halt.

