   BCI, BBB, attention block, tool-use loop, full silicon-NN):
   INVARIANT BACKBONE = {C, M}. Class C (cascade-orientation) + Class M
   (HDC bind) are the substrate-coupling-bridge invariant.

4. Silicon-NN with tool-use engages {L, M, C, K, I, D, E, A} = 8 of 14
   classes. INCLUDES all 5 wetware classes plus exactly the same {D, E, A}
   delta that BBB Channel (f) adds. Silicon-NN with tool-use is
   PARTITION-COEXISTENT with BBB-bipartite-substrate pattern.

5. Zero new primitive class. 14 A-N intact. Identity-not-implementation
   framing preserved: bridge IS D+E+C+M+I+A composed with L+M+C+K
   attention cascade.

